":"Tasting along the Alsace wine route","type":"experience","detail":"Colmar sits mid route, so cellars in Riquewihr, Kaysersberg and Ribeauville are a short bus or bike ride for Riesling and Gewurztraminer.","season":[4,5,6,7,8,9,10],"evidence":{"n_sources":6,"of":14,"urls":["https://en.wikivoyage.org/wiki/Colmar","https://wikitravel.org/en/Colmar","https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Colmar","https://www.tourisme-colmar.com/en/","https://www.europeanbestdestinations.com/destinations/colmar/"],"method":"web"},"sources":["web"]},{"name":"Flat bottomed boat ride through Little Venice","type":"activity","detail":"A short punt along the Lauch from the fishmongers quay, passing back gardens and low bridges at water level.","season":[3,4,5,6,7,8,9,10,11],"link":"https://www.tourisme-colmar.com/en/","evidence":{"n_sources":6,"of":14,"urls":["https://wikitravel.org/en/Colmar","https://www.visit.alsace/en/colmar/","https://www.tourisme-colmar.com/en/"],"method":"web"},"sources":["web"]},{"name":"Bartholdi Museum, home of the Statue of Liberty sculptor","type":"experience","detail":"The sculptor was born in this house, and the rooms hold his models and drawings for the statue and for Colmar's own fountains.","evidence":{"n_sources":5,"of":14,"urls":["https://en.wikivoyage.org/wiki/Colmar","https://www.visit.alsace/en/colmar/","https://www.tourisme-colmar.com/en/","https://www.europeanbestdestinations.com/destinations/colmar/"],"method":"web"},"sources":["web"]},{"name":"Maison des Tetes and the Pfister house","type":"activity","detail":"The two show houses of the old town, one hung with over a hundred carved faces, the other with a painted corner turret. Both are a few steps off the market square.","evidence":{"n_sources":4,"of":14,"urls":["https://fullsuitcase.com/colmar-best-things-to-do/","https://www.my-weekend-in-alsace.com/visit-colmar-do-see-taste/","https://thetwordtravel.com/things-to-do-in-colmar/"],"method":"web"},"sources":["web"]},{"name":"Colmar Christmas markets","t